WEBVTT

00:05:59.268 --> 00:06:01.724
But I got emails from people that said,

00:06:01.748 --> 00:06:04.811
"Oh my God, your husband
is such an asshole.

00:06:04.835 --> 00:06:07.646
How much money does
he spend on beer in a year?

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.662
You could take that money
and buy your banjo.

00:06:10.686 --> 00:06:12.551
Why don't you open a separate account?"

00:06:12.575 --> 00:06:16.127
I've been with him since I was 17,
we've never had a separate bank account.

00:06:16.151 --> 00:06:18.032
They said, "Separate your bank account.

00:06:18.056 --> 00:06:20.239
Spend your money;
spend his money, that's it."

00:06:20.263 --> 00:06:22.392
And then I got people saying, "Leave him."

00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:23.563
(Laughter)

00:06:23.587 --> 00:06:26.438
I was like, "OK, what?
Who are these people?

00:06:26.462 --> 00:06:27.976
And why are they reading this?"

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.385
And I realized: I don't
want to reach these people.